            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good. I used fresh sweet potatos and fresh apples.",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-26T13:22:46.980Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa Altmiller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great quick and easy side dish! I am not a huge fan of canned sweet potatoes but I did like them in this dish. My husband loved it and finished off the leftovers. The only change I will make next time is to only drain half of the cans of the yams and apples. Even after cooking for 30 minutes there was still too much liquid. And I did omit the pecans because I'm allergic.",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-11T19:17:18.423Z"
          }
